WEBVTT

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.730
Iris?

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:17.960
Hey! You're kidding me, right?!

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.130
Yotsuya-kun!

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.730
What did I tell you?

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.010
This is my job.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:33.380
Why?!

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.970
Why is this happening?!

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:38.850
This is... the same thing that 
happened to Jezby's dad, isn't it?

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:41.590
Yeah. A wireworm.

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:43.900
How could this...

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.220
<i>Iris was with us the whole time.</i>

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:50.680
So when did she get infected?

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:09.360
I can't believe this 
happened to Iris, too...

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:12.140
The same monster that got Bayne-san?

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.550
Jaca...

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:21.810
Sorry... We made it this far, 
but I just don't feel well...

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.250
You, too?

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.510
Actually, neither do we.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.090
What could this mean?

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:30.300
Their bodies?

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:31.590
Yes.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.740
Everyone's feeling weak and 
tired for unknown reasons.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.280
We feel just fine, though.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.240
Yeah...

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.230
D-Does that mean...

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.570
The same symptoms we saw on Jiffon Island.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:49.070
So is that Dragon Bishop doing another 
ritual somewhere around here, too?

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:57.010
You okay, Keita?

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:04.250
Y-Yeah. Totally fine.

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:07.180
She really liked you, huh?

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.830
I told you, I'm fine.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.400
It's so unfair.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:13.110
Huh?

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.050
We were just flung here out of nowhere,

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:18.660
then went through all these 
awful, scary things...

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:21.580
It's true for me, and all of them, too.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:25.730
And he tries to play it cool, but I 
think Yotsuya-kun feels it, too.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:27.570
But...

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.530
I don't want to die in a 
scenario as unfair as this.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.100
I guess...

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.130
Ow!

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.300
So let's all survive until the very end.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:41.750
You have to look out for your 
little brother, don't you?

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.050
Yeah.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:45.830
You're right.

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:50.910
Hey, why don't we all go to 
the beach together sometime?

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:54.200
The beach, huh? Sounds nice.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.180
Once we all make it back safe, that is.

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:03.740
You remember now?

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.430
New Eden is past the rising sun,

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:10.090
on the other side of this forest.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:11.500
What?

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:12.780
To the east, huh?

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.250
I've never gone that way.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.360
What should we do, Yuusuke?

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:21.010
If the Dragon Bishop really 
is involved in all this,

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:23.470
it'll be dangerous to just go in blind.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.670
Great Hero, you don't 
believe what Jezby says?

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:32.020
No, it's not that...

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:35.570
<i>We can't make this decision 
based on a childhood memory.</i>

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.440
<i>But...</i>

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:43.640
Monsters?!

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.480
Shit!

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:50.790
Dan-san, take everyone here and run!

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:51.570
Got it!

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:53.910
Kusue and Yuka, take the kids!

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:55.570
Right!

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.250
<b>Dead</b>

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.250
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.250
<b>Yotsuya Yuusuke</b>

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:06.410
Damn it! They really are strong!

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.510
This way, everyone!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.520
They're chasing us!

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:16.060
Lanan!

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:18.640
Yuka-chan!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.780
You okay? Hang in there!

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.430
Lanan!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:35.610
Lanan!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:45.980
Thanks.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.180
How many left?

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.010
One goblin,

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.670
three kobolds.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.340
No, make that two.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:58.670
Iu-chan! Let's take 'em all down at once!

00:06:58.930 --> 00:06:59.970
Okay!

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:06.880
We did it!

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:08.640
'Cause we don't wanna die, right?

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.070
You guys okay?

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.460
Yeah! How about you guys?

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.610
A troll...

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:21.210
<b>Dead</b>

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:21.210
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:21.210
<b>Shindou Iu</b>

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.110
Iu!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.030
Iu-chan!

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:29.060
Damn you!

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.270
Give Iu-chan back!

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:35.680
Don't, Hakozaki-san!

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:43.940
Huh?

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:44.890
What was...

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.700
Bastard! You're not getting away!

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:52.060
Don't chase it that far, idiot!

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:54.220
Long time no see.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.090
Cantil-san?!

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.230
Who's that guy?

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:08.950
I dunno...

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:13.180
<i>He looks good for his age...</i>

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:19.920
<i>Wait, chill out! I'm not into hot, 
older men... I don't think...</i>

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:24.400
Um, it's been... 
seventeen years, hasn't it?

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:28.030
I heard the tsunami took you away.

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:33.930
Yes, and right after that, 
someone saved my life.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.130
You're...

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:40.950
The great sorceress Fatina?

00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:44.450
Fatina-sama? That's the one who...

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.200
You know who Fatina is?

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.680
She's...

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.930
the lady who saved my life once.

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:58.210
I became Fatina's pupil after that,

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:00.600
and now I'm training in sorcery.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:04.780
Wait, so... that Dragon Bishop is dead?

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:05.690
Yes.

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:11.740
Um... Are sorcerers and 
Dragon Bishops enemies?

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:16.840
The Dragon Bishops are a group that 
seeks to resurrect the dragons.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:21.070
Should the dragon return, 
humanity will be destroyed.

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:29.770
We exist to stop that from happening.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:35.120
Fatina sensed that there was a 
Dragon Bishop in this area,

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:36.970
so she sent me here.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:41.420
Which means we were right. 
There is a Dragon Bishop nearby.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:45.250
But unfortunately, a few months ago,

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:49.880
a meteorite containing immense 
magic power fell near here.

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:51.310
A meteorite?

00:09:56.220 --> 00:10:01.090
I found a piece of it on the other 
side of that rocky mountain.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:06.890
It seems that meteorite has the 
ability to boost magic power.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.120
Is that why the monsters are stronger, too?

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.080
As I was following the meteorite's waves...

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:14.680
You found us.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:19.060
The blood ritual requires 
the life force of humans.

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:23.930
The village I found along the way was 
destroyed, so I thought I was too late,

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.990
but perhaps the power taken 
from it wasn't enough.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:30.110
The ritual is still being performed.

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:34.280
What are those?

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:36.620
Yggdramaple seeds.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.900
They grow by absorbing magic power.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:45.110
By growing these, the magic power of the 
meteorite in this area can be sealed.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:49.650
And that would seal the abnormal 
strength of the monsters, too?

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:53.430
<i>And our magic power along 
with it, probably.</i>

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:57.470
<i>But to be honest, magic hasn't 
been helping us much in battle,</i>

00:10:57.470 --> 00:10:58.980
<i>so this could save us.</i>

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.380
I'll grow it as much as I 
can with creature magic.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.780
We should be more worried about 
Iu-chan and Kusue-chan!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.440
That troll ate them!

00:11:07.440 --> 00:11:10.550
No need to panic. We can save 
them by cutting its belly open.

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:12.290
We know where it is.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.940
Hurry up, Yuusuke.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.520
I know, I know.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.480
The Kingdom of Deokk?!

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:24.420
Isn't the Deokk Kingdom

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.920
the kingdom you got tangled up 
with in the fourth quest?

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:32.240
Yeah. They really put us through hell.

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:36.310
We defeated the Dragon Bishop who 
was hiding in the palace there.

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:39.570
<i>There was one in that kingdom, too?</i>

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:42.730
It was about three years ago.

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.130
Who are you?!

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:48.520
I'm here at the king's command.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:51.320
This is the minister's chamber, is it not?

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:53.710
Yes! That is correct!

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:58.070
He's escaping!

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:00.360
A wyvern?

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.580
Not a problem.

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:04.620
It's food now.

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:08.380
An owl?!

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:11.110
Als, wis, ventous.

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:12.200
The incantation is complete!

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:13.750
Sylphede!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.260
Winds Shield!

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.960
What was his reason for 
being in the kingdom?

00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:30.180
To start a war and use the lives 
consequently lost in the blood ritual.

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:34.910
<i>Wait... The blood ritual 
is still continuing.</i>

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:37.330
<i>If the village of Zagroth wasn't enough,</i>

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:39.540
<i>is there a village or town nearby?</i>

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:42.530
<i>Does New Eden really exist?</i>

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:45.490
Hey, I think that's probably enough.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:50.820
It's like the thing from 
"Jack and the Beanstalk."

00:12:52.720 --> 00:12:56.300
I did push my creature magic to its limits.

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:58.500
Hey, there's fruit on it.

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:00.640
This fruit can be eaten.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.050
Sweet, they're edible!

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.330
I'll take some for emergency supplies!

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.270
So we have a supply of food for now.

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:10.880
I'm going to go investigate the area.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:13.050
There should be a magic circle somewhere.

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:15.390
We need to find that first.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:21.980
m 0 0 l 260 0 l 260 170 l 0 170

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:21.980
<b>[Blood Ritual]</b>

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:21.980
A ritual performed by the Dragon Bishops, a group
whose goal is to resurrect the dragons. The life force of
all humans within the ritual area is sucked out over time,
and once they die, the dragons takes their souls. Also, the
souls of any humans killed within the ritual area by
monsters or other humans become the nearby dragons'
possessions. When a great deal of killing is carried out
while the blood ritual is ongoing, the moment of the
dragons' resurrection draws closer.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:25.150
Okay, Glen-san, we'll count 
on you to handle the rest.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:25.900
Sure.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:28.150
Make sure you save them.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.660
Glen-san, will you be okay on your own?

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:36.030
If this thing will weaken the 
monsters, I should manage.

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:38.830
And there's something I 
want to find out, too.

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:40.490
Find out?

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:43.690
I'm sure it's just me 
overthinking things, though.

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:47.420
Don't worry. I can help out 
a little bit, at least.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:53.140
My brother's trying so hard to look cool 
because he's with a beauty like Glenda.

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:58.760
Don't worry. I'm gonna protect both of you.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:05.640
If Lanan dies, I really 
will be all alone...

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:08.450
Lanan just took a little blow to the head.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:10.100
He'll wake up soon.

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:11.970
Okay...

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:15.770
That thing sure made a big 
show of running away.

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:18.450
We won't even need to check the map.

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:20.250
I'm surprised, though.

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:22.980
I thought you'd say,

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:26.470
"We don't need to look for them. If we 
find New Eden and clear the quest,

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:28.670
everything will be fine."

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:31.240
There's still a horde 
of monsters out there.

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:34.100
We need everyone we can get 
in case we have to fight.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.550
Well, sure.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:44.510
The troll left the forest?

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:47.780
Also, this is what the outside looks like?

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:49.950
There it is!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.870
Look at the bastard, 
just chillin' like that!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:58.950
Give Iu-chan and Kusue-chan back!

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:02.830
Damn it! That idiot!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:09.720
Shit!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.050
<b>Dead</b>

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.050
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.050
<b>Torii Keita</b>

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:14.230
When that thing jumps, a shadow 
forms the moment it lands!

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:18.480
Right here!

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:24.840
It's fast! Way faster than it was before!

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:27.100
Did it get even stronger?

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:29.790
Majiha Arrow!

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:33.900
Heck yeah!

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:37.210
Of course! No matter how strong 
it gets, its eyes are...

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:39.940
Tokitate-san, get the other eye!

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:43.620
All right! It's my time to shine!

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:48.330
Its eye, damn it! Hit its eye!

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:51.840
<b>Dead</b>

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:51.840
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:51.840
<b>Tokitate Yuka</b>

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.300
Oh, crap...

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.270
We're dead...

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:07.650
Torii the Hero is back!

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:13.260
That's the second time I've 
been eaten by one of these things.

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:21.010
It's a total dead end.

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:23.380
Hey, look there!

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:26.730
Is that the main part of the meteorite 
Cantil-san told us about?

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:32.390
I see. Those little fragments 
scattered all over this area.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:36.830
Cantil-san, huh? That takes me back.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:39.640
He looks even more 
sophisticated and fine now!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.700
For real?

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:44.890
Yotsuya-kun?

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.690
New Eden might be up there.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.350
New Eden?

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:53.840
Jezby said it was beyond 
the forest, remember?

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:57.380
Also, it's to the east of Zagroth.

00:16:57.380 --> 00:17:00.560
You actually believe that story?

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:05.060
Somewhere nearby, there should still be 
enough humans to complete the ritual.

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:08.320
And if there are, there's nowhere 
they could be but up there.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:12.250
Can we climb all the way up there?

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.810
Sounds impossible.

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:16.830
You have the thing, right?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:17.900
Er, huh?

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.940
Jezby? Lanan?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:32.920
Lanan!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.780
You woke up?

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:40.450
It's dangerous to be out here alone.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.750
Froc?

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:45.100
You can talk?!

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:47.840
Where are we?

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:51.670
Um... You don't remember anything?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:56.590
Mom died... and then... and then...

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.040
I don't know...

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:02.610
It's okay! It's okay, all right?

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:07.260
For now, let's go see Jezby. 
She'll be happy to see you.

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:10.090
Jezby?

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:19.180
I remembered Tokitate-san comparing 
this to "Jack and the Beanstalk."

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:22.990
I did say that, but I didn't 
think we'd do it for real!

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:26.240
I can't believe it grew 
that quickly, though...

00:18:26.510 --> 00:18:29.090
It's because of that huge meteorite.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:32.620
The rise in magic power doesn't 
even compare to before.

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:35.210
Be grateful for my emergency supplies, too!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:37.290
I'm starting to get excited!

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:44.370
Again?!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:45.890
We're almost there!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:49.300
I take back what I said! 
This is killing me!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.390
You're... kidding me...

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.170
It was all for nothing?

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:02.780
I actually had my hopes up a little.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:04.400
Let's just go back.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:09.240
This can't be real...

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:11.300
Yotsuya-kun, let's go.

00:19:14.320 --> 00:19:18.700
<i>If you fell from here, 
you'd never make it back alive.</i>

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.590
No way...

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:26.410
Hey, Yuusuke!

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:27.980
What are you doing?

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:29.770
I'm gonna jump down.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:30.460
What?!

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.150
A shortcut?

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:36.650
Wait, no! You'll never survive 
a fall into a plunge pool!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.280
I don't want to go down there.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.080
Huh?

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.630
Take care of the rest.

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:43.610
What?!

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:49.920
<i>Crap, it's deeper than I thought.</i>

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:52.540
<i>Maybe I didn't think this through enough...</i>

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.370
<i>Huh? The current changed?</i>

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:19.820
Who are you people?

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:22.890
It's been a long time 
since anyone came here.

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:26.950
You're surprised to find a town in 
a place like this, aren't you?

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:29.700
Well, yeah...

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:32.550
About how many people live here?

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:34.620
I think 320...

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:40.140
Oh, but a baby was born 
recently, so it's 321 now.

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:41.690
That many?

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:44.420
Have you lived here your whole lives?

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:50.540
Yes. There's no fighting, so we've 
lived here in peace for generations.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:54.070
They say it was connected to 
the outside a long time ago.

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:58.230
Oh, I drifted in here from 
the outside myself, though.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:20:59.310
Drifted?

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:03.480
Yes. I used to live in a small 
village called Zagroth.

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:04.650
Zagroth?!

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:09.070
Does that mean this is... New Eden?

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:11.780
No, it doesn't have a name.

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:12.700
It doesn't?

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:18.550
A town with no connection to the outside 
world doesn't really need one, does it?

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:21.210
I don't know her!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:22.370
Lanan...

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:26.930
What's wrong with you? 
Don't you remember your big sister?

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:29.550
I don't have a big sister!

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:30.870
No...

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.750
Look closely at me, Lanan.

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:36.930
So it <i>was</i> you.

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:38.480
Huh?

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:41.790
You'll even take the form 
of such a young child?

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.990
What are you talking about?

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:46.330
Jezby...

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:49.610
You are the Dragon Bishop.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:54.960
<b>Dragon Bishop</b>

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:26.660
Next week on <i>Million Lives</i>...

